Hello Chris,

I implemented the function as a for loop and it worked perfectly:

getclustersN <- nimbleFunction(
  run = function(U = double(1)) {
    A <- length(U)+1
    K <- A - sum(U)
    V <- c(K)
    c=K
    for(i in 1:(A-1)){
      if(U[i]==0){
        c <- c-1
      }
      V <- c(V,c)
    }
    return(V)
    returnType(double(1))
  })

Thanks a lot for the help!
-Bernardo S. S.

